# Keep the Docker build context small and avoid copying Windows build output into Linux images
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user

# Angular: dependencies and build output are recreated inside the image
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/

.git/
.env
*.md

# Only the web-client image needs something from docker/ (its nginx template).
# The Dockerfiles themselves are always read by Docker, whatever this file says.
docker/postgres/
